@startuml Linkwise_Managed_Attempt
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9BA8AE
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
hide footbox

participant "MCP client" as Client #EFF5F8
participant "Station service" as Station #EFF5F8
participant "Simulated radio" as Radio
participant "Virtual modem pair\n+ B2F peers" as Pair

Client -> Station: Prepare channel
Station -> Radio: Configure + read back
Radio --> Station: Verified RX state
Station --> Client: Prepared handle
Client -> Station: Authorize preparation
Station --> Client: Single-use grant
Client -> Station: Start (handle + grant)
Station -> Station: Recheck and journal\nRetain lease
Station --> Client: Attempt ID
Station -> Pair: Spawn and attach with tokens\nCommand, DATA and PCM
Pair --> Station: Listener ready, then link-up

alt Normal completion
  Pair --> Station: B2F delivery + clean close
  Station -> Station: Verify both attachment hashes
else Abort after peer connection
  Client -> Station: Abort attempt
  Station -> Pair: Cancel clients and PCM relay
end

Station -> Pair: Stop and reap both modems
Station -> Radio: Confirm key-down
Station -> Station: Journal and release lease\nInhibit on cleanup failure
Station --> Client: Status or abort result
note over Client, Pair #EFF5F8
  Radio-free fixture. CMS and recipient status unknown.
end note
@enduml
